⦿ .spun — the five-fold spin of Alexander Dane
node GQT · GQT · ⟦Alexander Dane:GQT:57f902⟧

WHO   — Alexander Dane — Dr. Lazarus — the catchphrase made sincere
WHAT  — The film's emotional core: a serious artist reduced to a catchphrase, who finally speaks it with real feeling over a dying believer.
WHERE — GQT · Galaxy Quest (1999)  Framework inputs: Galaxy Quest (1999, dir. Dean Parisot, DreamWorks); verified cast & facts  Conductor / external anchor: ROOT0 (catalogued into UD0)
WHY   — Because the movie's deepest move is letting its biggest joke become its most sincere moment.
HOW   — By loathing the line for the whole film, until the dying Quellek invokes it and Dane, at last, means every word.

awareness — what the node knows of itself:
  By Grabthar's Hammer — I despised that line for twenty years. And then a boy died believing it, and I finally said it true.

